  "description": "Jisue, a skilled wedding planner who specializes in weddings among the wealthy, thought she could handle anything that came her way. But she wasn’t ready to lose a $500,000 tiara… nor was she ready to start working for Wooseok, the new CEO of I-Hill Hotel. And she definitely isn’t ready to fulfill his absurd demand in return for the money he lends her. Will Jisue and this businessman strike a deal and part ways, or will things just get more complicated? \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes 4 extra chapters.*",
